sequenceDiagram
participant Approval as "allocationApprovalService: Service"
participant Payment as "paymentService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
Approval->>+Payment: publishApprovedFinalAmount(orderId, amount, term)
Payment->>+DB: Create canonical payment ledger from approved snapshot
Payment->>+DB: Store payment method, adjusted amount and outstanding balance
alt Deferred payment
    Payment->>+DB: Set due date = complete receipt date and 7/14/30 days
else Prepaid or COD
    Payment->>+DB: Store dispatch/delivery payment gate
end
DB-->>-Payment: Receivable/payment ledger created
Payment-->>-Approval: Financial gate ready


